{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"ac82668b944498f96","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Imitation Learning (IL) / Behavior Cloning 从 SAT/CP solver 轨迹学习的 2024-2026 应用。\n\n**背景：** RL 路线学习成本高、需要 reward 设计。IL 直接从 expert solver trace 学，可能给 candidate ranker / branching 当 warm-start，效率高于 RL。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. IL for SAT/CSP 学术状态\n2. Behavior Cloning vs DAgger\n3. Strong branching imitation (Khalil et al. 经典)\n4. 2024-2026 进展（CAMBranch 等）\n5. 数据需求（vs RL）\n6. 我们 S4 AI dataset 适合 IL 吗\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得作 RL 的低成本替代\""},"uuid":"7889c8f5-1b23-4662-aa76-a9e9f13e55af","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:43.555Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
